    .desc = High-quality, heavy-duty rubber latex gloves. Expensive PPE, to protect you from all the meth you're making.
ent-FuClothingHandsGlovesCombatBloodred = blood-red combat gloves
    .desc = These tactical gloves are resistant to low voltage shocks, with high grip palms and padded knuckles. You feel unstoppable.
